      "content_md": "Hi Andres, \n\nwhat do you like to know? I first made a transmission master hologram \n\nof about 3x30 cm. There I used a spatial filter and a collimating mirror, the object was mounted at 90 degrees. Pathlengths about 3 meters. \n\nFor the rainbow copy, nearly same setup was used, so that reference and replay beam where nearly equal. for the copy also a spatial filter in the reference beam was used.",
